Open a second (new) file window and type in it so the file menu lists two
entries, one dirty, exercising genmenu3's file-name rendering and width calc.

-- input --
move 150 4
button 4
move 150 11
button 0
move 100 75
button 4
move 240 165
button 0
move 125 100
button 1
button 0
type abc
move 150 4
button 4
move 150 8
button 0
move 50 5
button 1
button 0
